{"name":"Nom Nom","hex":"#866745","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"nom nom","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Alternative form of om nom nom."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nom_nom"}],"entries":[{"title":"Com2uS Holdings","blocks":[{"text":"Com2uS Holdings ( 게임빌) is a public company based in Seoul, Republic of Korea, and Torrance, California, which develops and publishes video games for mobile devices. As of May 2017, the company's market capitalization is around 400 million dollars. On October 4, 2013, it acquired one of its main competitors, Com2uS."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Com2uS_Holdings"},{"title":"DKZ","blocks":[{"text":"DKZ was a South Korean boy band formed and managed by Dongyo Entertainment. The group consists of five members: Sehyeon, Mingyu, Jaechan, Juone, and Giseok. Wondae, Munik, and Kyoungyoon, left the group in March 2022, February and August 2023, respectively. They debuted on April 24, 2019, with the single album Dongkiz on the Block, and concluded their activities on May 31, 2026."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/DKZ_BrandOfTheYearAwards2022.png/330px-DKZ_BrandOfTheYearAwards2022.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DKZ"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/190816_JBJ95_%26_%EB%8F%99%ED%82%A4%EC%A6%88%280059%29%2C_%EC%B6%9C%EA%B7%BC%EA%B8%B8_%28KBS_%27%EB%AE%A4%EC%A7%81%EB%B1%85%ED%81%AC%28MUSICBANK%29%27_%EC%B6%9C%EA%B7%BC%EA%B8%B8%29_1m_12s.jpg/500px-190816_JBJ95_%26_%EB%8F%99%ED%82%A4%EC%A6%88%280059%29%2C_%EC%B6%9C%EA%B7%BC%EA%B8%B8_%28KBS_%27%EB%AE%A4%EC%A7%81%EB%B1%85%ED%81%AC%28MUSICBANK%29%27_%EC%B6%9C%EA%B7%BC%EA%B8%B8%29_1m_12s.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/190816_JBJ95_%26_%EB%8F%99%ED%82%A4%EC%A6%